179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (NeuroGrip is an advanced EEG-based brain-machine interface \(BMI\) system designed to control a robotic arm using intuitive motor imagery. Inspired by the paper Brain-Controlled Robotic Arm System Based on Multi-Directional CNN-BiLSTM Network Using EEG Signals, this project leverages deep learning techniques to decode EEG signals and translate them into real-time robotic arm movements.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
